Package: bestballBroSim
Title: Best Ball Tournament Simulation and Projection Engine
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Liberty", "Vincent", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "liberty@example.com")
Description: Layer A (player projections + simulations) and Layer B
    (tournament-aware pick EV pre-computation) engine for the BestBall Bro
    Chrome extension. Publishes JSON projection and tournament-building-block
    feeds to libertyvincent.github.io/bestball-bro-data, consumed by the
    BestBall Bro extension during live Underdog Fantasy best ball drafts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
