    httr2,
    digest,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    tibble,
    purrr,
    arrow,
    lubridate,
    matrixStats,
    cli
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    devtools,
    roxygen2
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
